31243::$$$message_0236_0000_0000$$$::Nothing out of the ordinary here.[lr]::
31244::$$$message_0236_0000_0001$$$::As usual,[se volume=30 storage=se621.wav] the neighborhoods here feel hardly lived in.[lr]::
31245::$$$message_0236_0000_0002$$$::I can't hear any screams nearby, nor any distant animal howls.[lr]::
31246::$$$message_0236_0000_0003$$$::The town looks brighter than usual, perhaps thanks to the white moonlight.::
31247::$$$message_0236_0001_0000$$$::"Nothing out of the ordinary. Guess I'll move on."[lr]::
31248::$$$message_0236_0001_0001$$$::I leave the European-style neighborhoods behind.[lr]::
31249::$$$message_0236_0001_0002$$$::Once I do, I spot a flash of red in the corner of my eye.[lr]::
31250::$$$message_0236_0001_0003$$$::One, two freshly painted mailboxes.::
6